#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/variables/SCAFFOLD_PLATFORMS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every scaffoldable platform key (discovered from available presets, plus any legacy\ntemplate-only platforms not yet backed by a preset)."
msgstr "Hver lykill fyrir uppsetningarhæfan vettvang (fundinn úr tiltækum forstillingum, auk eldri\neins konar sniðmát-vettvanga sem ekki eru enn studdir af forstillingu)."

