#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Transpile extra InstUI packages**"
msgstr "**Transpileraðu auka InstUI pakka**"

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — Next.js stillingaaðlögun."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Instructure UI sendir ESM-pakka sem Next þarf að transpila (`transpilePackages`), það algengasta smávandamálið\nþegar InstUI er keyrt á Next. `withPantoken` sameinar InstUI-pakkana inn í þennan lista. Umlykja\n`next.config`, og flytja svo inn `@pantoken/css` í rótarskipulagið þitt fyrir tokenana."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og endurflytur [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"

#: bundlers/next/src/interfaces/NextConfigLike.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A minimal Next config shape (only the field this adapter touches)."
msgstr "Lágmarks Next stillingarsnið (aðeins reiturinn sem þessi aðlögun snertir)."

#: bundlers/next/src/interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [withPantoken](../functions/withPantoken.md)."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir [withPantoken](../functions/withPantoken.md)."

#: bundlers/next/src/interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra package names to add to `transpilePackages`."
msgstr "Aukapakkanöfn til að bæta við `transpilePackages`."

#: bundlers/next/src/variables/INSTUI_TRANSPILE_PACKAGES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Instructure UI packages Next needs to transpile. Extend via [WithPantokenOptions](../interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md)."
msgstr "Instructure UI pakkarnir sem Next þarf að transpila. Útvíkka með [WithPantokenOptions](../interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md)."

#: bundlers/next/src/variables/INSTUI_TRANSPILE_PACKAGES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Feed the list into a manual transpilePackages**"
msgstr "**Settu listann inn í handvirka transpilePackages**"

