#: bundlers/panda/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/panda` — an Instructure design-token preset for Panda CSS."
msgstr "`@pantoken/panda` — fyrirfram skilgreind uppsetning hönnunar-tákna (design-token) fyrir Panda CSS."

#: bundlers/panda/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toPandaPreset](functions/toPandaPreset.md) converts any IR; [pantokenPreset](variables/pantokenPreset.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` preset.\nSpread it into your `panda.config.ts` `presets`, and the `_dark` condition tracks pantoken's\n`light-dark()` tokens automatically."
msgstr "[toPandaPreset](functions/toPandaPreset.md) breytir hvaða IR sem er; [pantokenPreset](variables/pantokenPreset.md) er tilbúna `rebrand` forsniðið.\nDreifðu því inn í `panda.config.ts` `presets` þína, og skilyrðið `_dark` heldur sjálfkrafa utan um\n`light-dark()` tákn pantoken."

