#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/tailwind` — a Tailwind CSS preset that maps Instructure design tokens into the theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/tailwind` — Tailwind CSS-forset sem kortleggur Instructure hönnunartákn inn í þemað."

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every token is exposed as a `var(--instui-*)` reference (not a concrete value), so Tailwind\nutilities like `bg-color-background-base` theme through the same CSS custom properties that\n`@pantoken/css` emits — light/dark and high-contrast all keep working."
msgstr "Öll tákn eru birt sem `var(--instui-*)`-tilvísun (ekki sem föst gildi), þannig að Tailwind hjálparverkfæri eins og `bg-color-background-base` stjórna þemanu í gegnum sömu sérsniðnu CSS-eiginleikana sem `@pantoken/css` sendir út — ljós/dökk og há- kontrast halda áfram að virka."

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenPreset](functions/pantokenPreset.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og endurflytur út [pantokenPreset](functions/pantokenPreset.md)"

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/interfaces/PantokenPresetOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [pantokenPreset](../functions/pantokenPreset.md)."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir [pantokenPreset](../functions/pantokenPreset.md)."

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/interfaces/PantokenPresetOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Also expose the primitive colour palette under a `primitive-` prefix (default: false)."
msgstr "Að auki sýna grunnlitalitasafnið undir forskeytinu `primitive-` (sjálfgefið: false)."

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/interfaces/TailwindPreset.md
#, no-c-format
