#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "`li` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Brauðmolar (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), `<li>` í `<ol>` foreldrisins; sá síðasti er núverandi síða."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `breadcrumb`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` modifiers adjust this member's separator spacing — see `breadcrumb`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Sýna-/aðskilnaðarmódelar `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` foreldra `breadcrumb` stilla bil aðskiljara þessa meðlims — sjá skjöl `breadcrumb` fyrir þá mótíf."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the current page's crumb with `aria-current=\"page\"` — on its `<a>` if it's a link, otherwise on the `<li>` itself."
msgstr "Merkja brauðmolinn fyrir núverandi síðu með `aria-current=\"page\"` — á `<a>` hans ef hann er hlekkur, annars beint á `<li>`."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md css/list.item.md css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Langform stytting fyrir `-size-lg`."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Langform stytting fyrir `-size-md`."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md css/list.item.md css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Langform stytting fyrir `-size-sm`."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the chevron separator after every crumb except the last; mirrors to `chevron-left` in `[dir=\"rtl\"]`."
msgstr "Sýnir bogaaðskiljarann eftir hvern brauðmol nema þann síðasta; endurspeglar `chevron-left` í `[dir=\"rtl\"]`."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "In a collapsed parent draws a masked back-arrow before this crumb's second-to-last link."
msgstr "Í samanbrotnu foreldri teiknar það stífa bak-ör fyrir framan næst síðasta hlekk þessa brauðmols."

#: css/breadcrumb.link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collapses the trail, showing only the previous crumb and a back arrow."
msgstr "Þrengir slóðina saman og sýnir aðeins fyrri brauðmolinn og bak-ör."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-breadcrumb` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "`.instui-breadcrumb` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stöðugt</span> — Brauðmolaaslóð með aðskiljum; síðasti brauðmoli er núverandi síða."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Automatically collapses to a back arrow on small screens. Use `breadcrumb.link` for each crumb."
