#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-context-view` — An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "`.instui-context-view` — Hækkað yfirlit með ör (caret), staðsetjanlegt á hvaða hlið sem er; virkar sem innbyggt `[popover]`."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caret is two stacked `::before`/`::after` triangles (border then fill) so it reads correctly against a matching surface; as a `[popover]` it needs the same open/`popovertarget` wiring as `popover`, but unlike `tooltip`, it dismisses on outside click or Escape."
msgstr "Örin er tvö staflað `::before`/`::after` þríhyrningarnir (brún og svo fylling) svo þau sjást rétt á samsvarandi flöt; sem `[popover]` þarf hún sama opna/`popovertarget` tengingu og `popover`, en ólíkt `tooltip` lokast hún við smelli utan við eða Escape."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A context view frames a callout with a caret. As a popover it rides the top layer and closes when you click away or press Esc."
msgstr "Samhengissýn rammar inn tilkynningu með bendli. Sem sprettigluggi situr hún efst á laginu og lokast þegar þú smellir annars staðar eða ýtir á Esc."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dark (inverse) colour scheme."
msgstr "Dökkt (öfugt) litaspjald."

#: css/context-view.md css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit below the anchor."
msgstr "Sætið undir festingunni."

#: css/context-view.md css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the end (inline-end) of the anchor."
msgstr "Sætið í enda (inline-end) festingarinnar."

#: css/context-view.md css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the start (inline-start) of the anchor."
msgstr "Sætið í byrjun (inline-start) festingarinnar."

#: css/context-view.md css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit above the anchor."
msgstr "Sætið fyrir ofan festinguna."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's inner fill triangle."
msgstr "Teiknar innri fyllingu þríhyrnings örvarinnar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's outer border triangle."
msgstr "Teiknar ytri brún þríhyrnings örvarinnar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) and the native `[popover]` API behind an `@supports` guard; needs a recent Chromium or Safari, and falls back to a UA-centred popover elsewhere."
msgstr "- Notar CSS anchor-staðsetningu (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) og innbyggða `[popover]` API-ið á bak við `@supports` vörn; þarf nýlega Chromium eða Safari og fellur yfir í UA-miðuðu popover annars staðar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer popover.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A smaller hover or focus callout."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Almenn popover fyrir efri lag.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — Minni yfirlitsbóma fyrir hover eða fókus."

#: css/cursor.md
