#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Stíllinn á þessum meðlim er endurskilgreindur af foreldra `modal` með `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse` stillingunum — sjá `modal`'s eigin skjöl fyrir þessar stillingar."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — Aðgerðarröðin (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Foreldra-`modal`'s `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse` stillingar breyta útliti þessa þáttar — sjá `modal`'s eigin skjal fyrir þessar stillingar."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — Titlaröðin (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — Samtalsflötur (virkar á innfæddan &lt;dialog&gt;); haus/mál/undirskrift hlutar."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Sjá meðlimina `modal.header`, `modal.body` og `modal.footer` fyrir einstaka hluta."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Opna innfædda `<dialog>` með `showModal()` fyrir modal merkingu og Esc-til-loka, og nefna hann með `aria-labelledby` sem bendir á `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Lítil"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " — a narrow modal."
msgstr " — þröngur modalgluggi."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Loka"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Óskýrða bakgrunninn fyrir aftan modalinn."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "Dökkur stíll fyrir hliðarljós (samhengi við media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Endur-litar hvern hluta fyrir dökkt útlit."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Þéttari innri fylking hluta. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Míknar á fyllingu hvers hluta."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Takmarkað við útsýnisglugga og skrun í body. @affects modal.body — Skrúnar body þegar modalinn er takmarkaður við gluggann."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Mældur eftir efni."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Frá brún til brúnar."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Breiður modal. Langt form alias af `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "Breiður modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "Mjór modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Mjór modal. Langt form alias af `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Dempar síðuna fyrir aftan samtalsgluggann sem grímu og frostar hana undir `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Stílar innfæddan &lt;dialog&gt; og `::backdrop`; efsta lags útprentun og bakgrunnsstíll þurfa vafra sem styður dialog-þáttinn."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Tray er sama myndefni fyrir úrlausn með möguleika til að vísa frá, fest við skjábrún."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — Gervi-númerainntak með +/- snúningsdálki."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "Hnapparnir í `.arrows` eru `aria-hidden` og eingöngu sjónrænir — að hækka/lækka gildið við smell er JS neytandans að tengja."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Settu aðgengilegt nafn á `<input>` (t.d. `aria-label`) svo reiturinn eigi gildið; +/- snúningshnapparnir eru skrautlegir og merktir `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md css/simple-select.md css/text-area.md css/text-input.md
#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
