msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Deilir sama gervi-inntaksútliti.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Önnur talnainntaksstýring."

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` sem samsetjanlegir, globalir klasar — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — hægt að nota einfalda eða sem keðju á hvaða íhlut sem er."

#: css/overflow.md
