msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — Fjölröðauppfærsla með sömu ástandum og stærðum.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Tölulegt inntak sem deilir þessum útlitshluta.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — Innfæddur valkostur sem deilir þessum reit-útlitshluta.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Umlykur þetta inntak með slotum fremst og aftast."

