msgstr "Byggt á sama innbyggða `<details>` grunninum og toggle-details; settu `<summary>` fyrst svo það verði smellanleg yfirlitsröð og restin verði fellingarinnihald."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Háþróaðar stillingar"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These options are revealed when the group is expanded. The header row carries a chevron that rotates on open, and the content sits below a divider."
msgstr "Þessar valkostir birtast þegar hópurinn er opnaður. Yfirskriftarröðin ber ör sem snýst við opnun, og efnið er staðsett fyrir neðan skiljara."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "Teiknar chevron-ör samantektarröðarinnar, falið tákn sem snýst til að vísa niður þegar hópurinn er opinn."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — Einföld, órammað útgáfa af sama upplýsingasvæðinu."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — CSS \"tooltip\"-bóla fyrir hover og focus, sem hægt er að staðsetja á hvaða hlið sem er."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "Breyting er hreint CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), svo bólan nær aðeins til lyklaborðsnotenda í gegnum fókus-færandi virkjara; ólíkt `popover` er hún ekki hægt að henda eða virkja með smelli."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "Bendið virkjann að bólunni með aria-describedby og gefið búlunni role=\"tooltip\"."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Default placement is top"
msgstr "Sjálfgefin staðsetning er efst"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "Sýnið virkjatákn (glyph) við hlið tooltip-bólunnar."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "Bólan; `-placement-*` stillir á hvora hliðina hún snýr."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Stærra, smell-virkjað og fest yfirborð.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Skylt fest yfirborð með vísanda (pointer)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Hreyfistigs-flokkar fyrir `Transition` íhlutinn — `.instui-transition` og stigsflokkarnir (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, o.s.frv.) — nota má beint eða tengja við hvaða íhlut sem er."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animated content"
msgstr "Animerað efni"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "Breytingartegund/stigsflokkur sem kveikt er á af keyrslutíma (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "Hreyfitímalengd (sjálfgefið `300ms`); yfirstilla til að hraða eða hægja á öllum breytingastigum."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "Tímasetning hreyfingar (sjálfgefið `ease-in-out`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — Fest við brúnina og rennur inn frá hvaða hlið sem er; innfæddur `[popover]` eða `<dialog>`."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "Staðsetningar fyrir byrjun/endi ákvarðast miðað við `inset-inline` (rökrétt, áttavitandi); rennsli-umbreytingin endurspeglast sjálfkrafa undir yfirliggjandi `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, svo engin auka merkimiðaþörf er fyrir hægri‑til‑vinstri uppsetningar."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "Skúffan er samtals‑ eða popover‑yfirborð, svo nefnið hana með `aria-label` eða `aria-labelledby`, og lokunarstýringin ber `aria-label` (í dæminu notar `.instui-close-button` `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Síur"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tray slides in from the start edge and fills the viewport height."
msgstr "Skúffa rennur inn frá upphafsbrún og fyllir hæð skjágluggans."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "toggle tray"
msgstr "Sýna/fela skúffu"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "Fest við neðri brún."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "Fest við endabrún (inline-end)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(sjálfgefið) Fest við byrjunarbrún (inline-start)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "Fest við efri brún."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- Opnar með innfæddu `[popover]` API og `@starting-style`; rennslið situr fyrir aftan `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` vörð, svo vafrar sem ekki styðja vörðina opna samt skúffuna, nema án rennslis."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — Sama mynstur með afturkallanlegu yfirlagi, miðstillt í stað þess að vera fest við brún.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Almennt efri yfirborð sem þetta byggir á."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — Afhjúpunartré af innfelldum söfnum og laufliðum, með snúningsörvum."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "Hvert safn er innfæddur `<details>`; að fella þau inn í hvert annað byggir upp tréð, og vafrarinn sér um að opna og loka hverri grein."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
