msgstr "Laufliður í trénu."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "Teiknar afhjúpunarörvar hvers safns, hulda táknmynd sem snýst niður þegar grein er opin."

#: css/tree-browser.md
