msgstr "Kortleggur táknkóða í [IconEntry](../interfaces/IconEntry.md), eða `undefined` þegar engin samsvörun finnst."

#: packages/core/src/type-aliases/Mode.md
#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/Mode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
