msgstr "Litaþema sem er fáanlegt í `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`."

#: packages/core/src/variables/ICON_COLOR_SPECIAL_VALUES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon colour values that exist nowhere else in the generated tokens."
msgstr "Litagildi tákna sem finnast hvergi annars í þeim mynduðu tokens."

#: packages/core/src/variables/ICON_COLOR_SPECIAL_VALUES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `inherit`: the CSS `currentColor` keyword.\n- `ai`: a gradient composed from two `aiSecondary` gradient icon-colour tokens."
msgstr "- `inherit`: CSS-lykilorðið `currentColor`.\n- `ai`: gradient samsettur úr tveimur `aiSecondary` gradient icon-colour tokens."

#: packages/model/src/functions/defineToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a well-formed [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) from partial input, defaulting `syntax` to `\"*\"` and\n`inherits` to `true`. Plugins import this from `@pantoken/model` to avoid depending on\n`@pantoken/core`; for smart CSS syntax inference use `defineToken` from `@pantoken/core`."
msgstr "Byggja vel myndaðan [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) úr hluta af inntaki, með `syntax` sjálfgefið sem `\"*\"` og\n`inherits` sem `true`. Viðbætur sækja þetta frá `@pantoken/model` til að forðast háð\n`@pantoken/core`; fyrir snjalla CSS-setningargreiningu notaðu `defineToken` frá `@pantoken/core`."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/model` — the zero-dependency type contracts for the pantoken token IR."
msgstr "`@pantoken/model` — týpusamningar án utanaðkomandi háða fyrir pantoken token IR."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `<image>` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."
msgstr "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One entry in the token deprecation ledger — the lifecycle of a single dropped upstream token."
msgstr "Eitt innlegg í færslubók um úrelt tákn — lífsferill eins fjarlægs uppstreymistákns."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A shim value comes from EITHER `replacement` (emit `var(replacement)`, so theming flows through) OR\n`value` (freeze the last-known literal, when the drop has no canonical replacement). Exactly one is\nexpected; an entry with neither emits no shim."
msgstr "Gildi fyrir umboð kemur EÐAÐ frá `replacement` (emits `var(replacement)`, þannig að þemaflæði berst í gegn) EÐA\n`value` (frosið síðasta þekkta bókstafsgildi þegar brottfallið hefur enga kanóníska staðgengil). Nákvæmlega eitt er\nvænt; færsl a án hvorugs skilar engu umboði."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The dropped upstream token name, e.g. `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`."
msgstr "Nafn fjarlægs uppstreymistákns, t.d. `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream release that dropped it, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream release that dropped it, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Forward the shim to a canonical token (emits `var(replacement)`)."
msgstr "Áframsenda umboðið á kanónískt tákn (sendir út `var(replacement)`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Freeze the shim to a literal (the token's last-known value) when there's no replacement."
msgstr "Frysa umboðið í bókstaflegt gildi (síðasta þekkta gildi táknsins) þegar engin staðgengill er."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A human note rendered in the compatibility docs and the changelog."
msgstr "Mannleg athugasemd sem birtist í samhæfisskjölum og breytingaskrá."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationLedger.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The committed token deprecation ledger (`formats/tokens/deprecations.json`)."
msgstr "Skuldbundin afskráningarskrá tokena (`formats/tokens/deprecations.json`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationLedger.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ledger schema version."
msgstr "Útgáfa skema skrárinnar."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationLedger.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecation entries, one per dropped upstream token."
msgstr "Afskráningarskrár, ein fyrir hvern felldan upstream-token."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/PropertyRule.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A typed `@property` registration."
msgstr "Tegundabundin `@property` skráning."

#: packages/model/src/type-aliases/UpstreamRef.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An upstream reference in `<tier>@<version>` form, e.g. `\"ui@11.7.4\"` or `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`."
msgstr "An upstream reference in `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` form, e.g. `\"ui@11.7.4\"` or `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/capabilitiesOf.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The capabilities a factoried plugin declares, or `undefined` for a non-factoried plugin."
msgstr "Færni sem factoried-viðbót tilkynnir, eða `undefined` fyrir ekki-factoried-viðbót."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filter a plugin list to those that participate in `stage`, warning about the rest."
msgstr "Sía lista af viðbótum niður í þær sem taka þátt í `stage`, og vara við hinum."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
