msgstr "aðeins lesið [`PantokenPlugin`](../../../core/src/interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)[]"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registered plugins."
msgstr "Skráðar viðbætur."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stage being run."
msgstr "Stigið sem er keyrt."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugins that have a hook for `stage`."
msgstr "Viðbæturnar sem eiga krók fyrir `stage`."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/checkPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Keep only the plugins that participate in a stage**"
msgstr "**Geyma aðeins viðbæturnar sem taka þátt í stigi**"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/definePlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create a pantoken plugin from its hooks. The result is a normal `PantokenPlugin` branded with the\ncapabilities inferred from the hooks you provided."
msgstr "Búðu til pantoken viðbót úr krokunum sínum. Niðurstaðan er venjuleg `PantokenPlugin` merkt með þeim\nhæfileikum sem ályktað er af krokunum sem þú gafst."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/definePlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin `name` plus any of the `tokens`/`icons`/`css`/`rehype`/`native` hooks."
msgstr "Viðbótin `name` auk hvaða af `tokens`/`icons`/`css`/`rehype`/`native` krokunum."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/definePlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A branded [PantokenPlugin](../../../core/src/interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)."
msgstr "Merkt [PantokenPlugin](../../../core/src/interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/definePlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**A unified tokens + css plugin**"
msgstr "**Sameinað tokens + css viðbót**"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/extendPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a plugin on top of another. Same-stage hooks are composed: `tokens` runs `base` then\n`overrides` (which sees base's output); `css` merges both `CssContribution`s; `icons`/`native` run\nboth; `rehype` chains resolvers (overrides first). Capabilities are the union."
msgstr "Byggja við viðbót ofan á aðra. Krokar á sama stigi eru samsettir: `tokens` keyrir `base` then\n`overrides` (sem sér úttak grunnsins); `css` sameinar bæði `CssContribution`s; `icons`/`native` keyra\nbæði; `rehype` keðjar upplausnara (yfirskrifar fyrsta). Hæfileikar eru sammengi."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/extendPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin to extend."
msgstr "Viðbótin (plugin) sem á að framlengja."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/extendPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hooks (and an optional `name`) layered on top."
msgstr "Krokar (og valfrjáls `name`) lagðir ofan á."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/extendPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A new branded plugin."
msgstr "Nýtt merkt plugin."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/extendPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Add an extra CSS contribution on top of a base plugin**"
msgstr "**Bæta við auka CSS-framlagi ofan á grunn-viðbót**"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/isFactoried.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "True when a plugin was created by [definePlugin](definePlugin.md) (or [extendPlugin](extendPlugin.md))."
msgstr "Satt þegar viðbót var búin til með [definePlugin](definePlugin.md) (eða [extendPlugin](extendPlugin.md))."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/makeResolver.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/makeResolver.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a resolver that expands `var(--x)` references to concrete leaf values against `base` (plus\nany `overrides`). With `mode` it collapses `light-dark()` to that branch; without, it leaves\n`light-dark()` in place."
msgstr "Búa til resolver sem stækkar tilvísanir `var(--x)` í raunveruleg blaðgildi gegn `base` (að auki\nöðru `overrides`). Með `mode` þrengir það `light-dark()` í þá grein; án þess skilur það\n`light-dark()` óbreytt."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/makeResolver.md
#: packages/plugin-kit/src/functions/resolveTokens.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/makeResolver.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/resolveTokens.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenNames.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/unknownReferences.md
