msgstr "Valkostir sem eru sameiginlegir fyrir utility-class emitters."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. Any truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); any\nfalsy value (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) drops the prefix entirely (`.bg-…`)."
msgstr "Forskeyti fyrir klasa. Hvaða truthy strengur sem er setur nöfnarými fyrir hvern flokk (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); hvaða\nfalsy gildi (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) fjarlægir forskeytið alveg (`.bg-…`)."

#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/ColorUtilityEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One semantic colour family entry: a bare name (resolved against `--instui-color-<family>-<name>`)\n or an explicit `[name, value]` pair — the second element is `var()`-wrapped if it's a `--custom-prop`\n name, or used verbatim otherwise (a `light-dark(…)` expression, a raw keyword like `transparent`)."
msgstr "One semantic colour family entry: a bare name (resolved against `--instui-color-&lt;family&gt;-&lt;name&gt;`)\n or an explicit `[name, value]` pair — the second element is `var()`-wrapped if it's a `--custom-prop`\n name, or used verbatim otherwise (a `light-dark(…)` expression, a raw keyword like `transparent`)."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/LIGHT_DARK_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `light-dark(<light>, <dark>)` value; capture groups 1 and 2 are the two branches."
msgstr "A `light-dark(&lt;light&gt;, &lt;dark&gt;)` value; capture groups 1 and 2 are the two branches."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_AUTO_STEP.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `auto` step — margin only, spelled the same both ways."
msgstr "Skrefið `auto` — aðeins jaðar, stafað eins báðar leiðir."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_STEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The pantoken spacing scale, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — the single shared source for\n`@pantoken/components`' spacing/gap utilities and `@pantoken/interactions`' `resolveSpace`, so the\ntwo never drift apart."
msgstr "Pantoken bilaskali, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — eina sameiginlega uppsprettan fyrir\nbil- og bilgap-verkfæri `@pantoken/components` og `@pantoken/interactions`' `resolveSpace`, svo þau\nrekist aldrei í sundur."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/VAR_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `var(--custom-prop)` reference (optional fallback); capture group 1 is the property name."
msgstr "Tilvísun í `var(--custom-prop)` (valfrjáls varakostur); fangshópur 1 er eignarnafnið."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for a named theme (using the vendored `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."
msgstr "Búa til Android resource XML fyrir nafngreint þema (með því að nota innbyggða `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths of the written `colors.xml` and `dimens.xml`."
msgstr "Slóðir fyrir rituðu `colors.xml` og `dimens.xml`."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for an explicit token IR."
msgstr "Búa til Android resource XML fyrir tilgreint token-IR."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#: platforms/flutter/src/functions/toFlutter.md
#: platforms/swift/src/functions/toSwift.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Emit a specific theme's IR**"
msgstr "**Búa til IR fyrir tiltekið þema**"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with icon VectorDrawables**"
msgstr "**Dökkur hamur með VectorDrawable-táknum**"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — sendir Instructure hönnunarmerki út sem Android resource XML."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Flatar IR-ið niður í áþreifanleg, einstillingagildi (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), og sendir síðan út `res/values/colors.xml` (litartákn) og `res/values/dimens.xml` (víddartákn) í gegnum `@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary beitir Android-breytingunum (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og endurflytur út [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."
msgstr "Stillingar fyrir [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The output directory; files are written under `<outDir>/res/values`."
msgstr "The output directory; files are written under `&lt;outDir&gt;/res/values`."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#: platforms/swift/src/interfaces/GenerateSwiftOptions.md
#: renderers/astro/src/interfaces/InstUIOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to emit (default: `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Þemað sem á að senda út (sjálfgefið: `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#: platforms/swift/src/interfaces/GenerateSwiftOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which `light-dark()` mode to resolve (default: `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "Hvaða `light-dark()` hátt á að leysa (sjálfgefið: `\"light\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to also emit as VectorDrawables under `res/drawable` (default: none)."
msgstr "Nöfn tákna sem einnig á að senda út sem VectorDrawables undir `res/drawable` (sjálfgefið: engin)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build both theme.css and theme.js for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Búa til bæði theme.css og theme.js fyrir tiltekna veitanda/eignaval."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildThemeCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build theme.css content for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Búa til innihald theme.css fyrir tiltekið val á veitanda/eignum."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildThemeJs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build theme.js content for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Smiða innihald theme.js fyrir tiltekna veitanda/auðlindaval."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component-style sheets for a given theme/mode pair (token sheet plus the constant set)."
msgstr "Stílblöð fyrir íhluti fyrir tiltekið þema/stillingarpar (token-skjalið auk föstu safnsins)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — tilbúið til upphleðslu `theme.css`/`theme.js` fyrir Theme Editor í Canvas LMS\nmeð fyrirfram tengdu CSS sem pantoken hýsir á CDN. Notað af `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` pallinum; einnig hægt að nota sjálfstætt."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` eru sjálfgefnar jsDelivr-útgáfur án föstunar — notaðu [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) til að\nmiða á annan CDN-veitanda, festa útgáfu, eða skipta inn öðrum pantoken-/þriðja aðila auðlindum."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "CDN-þjónustan sem á að búa til slóðir fyrir. Sjálfgefið er jsDelivr ef hún er ekki tilgreind."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pins the version for every asset below that doesn't specify its own `version`."
msgstr "Læsir útgáfuna fyrir allar neðangreindar auðlindir sem tilgreina ekki sitt eigið `version`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token theme variant. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"`. Ignored when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Breytileg þema fyrir tokens. Sjálfgefið er `\"rebrand\"`. Hunsuð þegar `css` er gefið."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode. Defaults to `\"light\"`. Ignored outside the `rebrand` theme, or when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Stilling fyrir endurmerkingu tokens. Sjálfgefið er `\"light\"`. Hunsuð utan `rebrand` þemans eða þegar `css` er gefið."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Stílblöð fyrir íhliti. Sjálfgefið er [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) fyrir `theme`/`mode`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Leturgerðarskrár. Sjálfgefið er [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Skript(ur). Sjálfgefið er [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "Þýddar athugasemdastrengir. Sjálfgefið er [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "Ein skrá til að hlaða frá CDN, auðkennd með npm-pakkaheiti og slóð innan hans."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "Nafn npm-pakkans, t.d. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Slóðin innan pakkans, t.d. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Slepptu til að vísa í rót pakkans."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Yfirskiptir útgáfu frá veitanda/byggingarstigi einungis fyrir þessa skrá."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Fyrir veitendur sem umbreyta JS sjálfgefið (esm.sh): `false` leyfir veitandanum að beita venjulegri\nESM-umbreytingu sinni (þetta er nauðsynlegt til að `import` raunverulegan inngangspunkt pakkans). Sjálfgefið er `true` — afhenda\nskrána orðrétta, nauðsynlegt fyrir fyrirsmíðuð/ekki-ESM eignir eins og CSS-stykki og IIFE-bundla."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "CDN sem getur þjónað npm pakkaskrám. Veitendur festa aldrei pakkana nafn inn í kóða — þeir vita aðeins\nhvernig á að mynda URL úr [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Stöðugt auðkenni, t.d. `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable name, e.g. `\"jsDelivr\"`."
msgstr "Mannlæsanlegt nafn, t.d. `\"jsDelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) is implemented."
msgstr "Hvort [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) er útfært."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the URL for a single file."
msgstr "Býr til URL fyrir eina skrá."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds one URL that serves multiple files concatenated together. Required iff `supportsCombine`."
msgstr "Býr til eitt URL sem þjónar mörgum skrám sem eru samsett saman. Nauðsynlegt þegar og aðeins þegar `supportsCombine`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/ThemeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The translatable strings baked into theme.css/theme.js's comments."
msgstr "Þýðanlegu strengirnir sem innbyggðir eru í athugasemdir theme.css/theme.js."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeMode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode — ignored for the `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast` variants."
msgstr "Endurmerkingartákna stilling — hunsuð fyrir `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast` afbrigðin."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeVariant.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pantoken token theme variant."
msgstr "Afbrigði af pantoken token þema."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/CDN_PROVIDERS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Providers available out of the box, keyed by [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)."
msgstr "Veitarar tilbúnir til notkunar úr kassann, merktir með [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_CDN_PROVIDER_ID.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The provider used when none is specified."
msgstr "Veitandinn sem notaður er þegar enginn er tilgreindur."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_CSS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets, combined into theme.css's first `@import` where the provider allows it."
msgstr "Stílskjöl fyrir íhluti, samsett í fyrsta `@import` í theme.css þar sem veitandinn leyfir það."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s) — always loaded as their own `@import`(s), separate from the component styles."
msgstr "Leturblöð — alltaf hlaðin sem sínar eigin `@import`(s), aðskilin frá stílum íhlutanna."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s) theme.js injects via `<script>` tags."
msgstr "Script(s) theme.js injects via `&lt;script&gt;` tags."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "English defaults, used for any key a caller's `strings` override doesn't supply."
msgstr "Enskt sjálfgefið gildi, notað fyrir hvaða lykil sem yfirsögn (override) hjá kallaðilanum `strings` skilar ekki."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/generateCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for a named theme. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "Útgefur Compose Kotlin fyrir nafngreint þema. Skilar skráarslóðinni sem var skrifuð."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for an explicit token IR. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "Útflutningur Compose Kotlin fyrir skýrt token-IR. Skilar slóð skráarinnar sem var skrifuð."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with a custom object name**"
msgstr "**Dökk stilling með sérsniðið hlutarheiti**"

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/compose` — emit Instructure design tokens as Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), via Style\nDictionary. It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed\ntokens (colours, dimensions, numbers)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/compose` — flytur út Instructure design-tákna sem Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), í gegnum Style\nDictionary. Það flatar IR niður í áþreifanleg, einstillingargildi og heldur þeim táknum sem hafa innbyggða gerð\n(liti, víddir, tölur)."

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og endurflytur [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md)."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md)."

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated Kotlin object name (default `PanTokens`)."
msgstr "Heiti myndaðs Kotlin-objekts (sjálfgefið `PanTokens`)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/machineName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert a display name to a Drupal machine name (`lower_snake`)."
msgstr "Breyta sýnilegu nafni í Drupal vélrænt nafn (`lower_snake`)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the files for a Drupal sub-theme that loads the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "Byggja skrárnar fyrir Drupal undirþema sem hleður Instructure tokens."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme files, paths relative to the theme directory."
msgstr "Þemaskrárnar, slóðir miðaðar við þema möppu."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build and write a standalone sub-theme**"
msgstr "**Byggja og skrifa sjálfstætt undirþema**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build a sub-theme on top of a base theme**"
msgstr "**Byggja undirþema ofan á grunnþema**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/drupal` — emit an Instructure-themed Drupal sub-theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/drupal` — búa til undirþema fyrir Drupal með Instructure-þema."

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/<machine>/`."
msgstr "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/&lt;machine&gt;/`."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/DrupalFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A generated file: a theme-relative path and its contents."
