msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — þema Foundation for Sites með Instructure táknum."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation er Sass-fyrst, svo þetta pakkaleiðir tvö lög. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) framkallar Sass-partial í stíl `_settings` sem bendir stillingabreytur Foundation á `var(--instui-*)`, þannig að Sass-uppsetning þýðir Instructure útlitið á meðan keyrslutímatemning varðveitirst með sömu sérsniðnu eiginleikunum. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) framkallar þunnt CSS-yfirlag sem þemagerir algengar þýddar klasa (`.button`, `.callout`, hlekki) á sama hátt — gagnlegt þegar neytir stendur á lager Foundation CSS og vill einfaldlega leggja Instructure-liti ofan á án endurþýðingar."

