msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Bæta `!important` við yfirlýsingar íhluta svo þær sigrast á stílum Pendo (sjálfgefið `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Fjarlægja ónotuð `--instui-*` tákn (sjálfgefið `true`; þegar slökkt er er sent með öll táknin)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Breyta `@property` at-reglum í einfaldar yfirlýsingar sérsniðinna eiginleika með\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (sjálfgefið `false`). `true` notar sjálfgefnar stillingar tappsins með\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` svo yfirlýsingarnar lendi innan `@scope` blokkarinnar.\nSendu [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) hlut til að yfirskrifa einstök sjálfgefin gildi."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Breyta nöfnum `--instui-*` í lágmarks base-26 auðkenni með [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(sjálfgefið `false`). Örugg hér þar sem fulla tákna- og íhluta stílblaðið er\nsjálfstætt bundið safn. Sendu [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) hlut til að yfirskrifa sjálfgefnar stillingar."

