#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) returns a plain `ThemeVars`-shaped object (so `@storybook/theming`\nstays an optional peer) with colours resolved concretely from the IR. Pass it to Storybook's\n`manager`/`preview` theme."
msgstr "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) skilar einföldu `ThemeVars`-laga hlut (svo `@storybook/theming`\nverður valfrjáls jafningur) með liti leystum skýrt úr IR. Sendu það í Storybook-þemað\n`manager`/`preview`."

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og endurflytur [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"

#: renderers/storybook/src/type-aliases/StorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Storybook theme object (a subset of `ThemeVars`)."
msgstr "Storybook þema hlutur (undirmengi af `ThemeVars`)."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Svelte action: `<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` renders the icon's inline SVG into the node."
msgstr "Svelte-aðgerð: `<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` teiknar inline SVG-táknið inn í hnútinn."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The host element."
msgstr "Gestgjafaþátturinn."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name."
msgstr "Nafn táknsins."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register custom elements with locale-specific strings and direction."
msgstr "Skrá sérsniðna þætti með staðbundnum strengjum og textastefnu."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](#) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](#) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Tekur við fullunni [LocaleBundle](#) *eða* hráum BCP47-tákna streng. Þegar streng er sendur, afleiðir [makeStrings](#) vikudagana með `Intl.DateTimeFormat` og öll önnur strengi falla aftur á ensku; sendu bundle til að fá fullar þýðingar."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](#) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "[LocaleBundle](#) hlutur, eða BCP47-tákni (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registry to define into (defaults to `globalThis.customElements`)."
msgstr "Skráin sem á að skilgreina í (sjálfgefið er `globalThis.customElements`)."

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Passed through to `register()` (e.g. `prefix`, `only`)."
msgstr "Sendt áfram til `register()` (t.d. `prefix`, `only`)."

#: renderers/svelte/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/svelte` — Svelte helpers over `@pantoken/web-components`."
msgstr "`@pantoken/svelte` — Svelte hjálparverkfæri fyrir `@pantoken/web-components`."

#: renderers/svelte/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`icon` is a Svelte action that renders an Instructure glyph into an element. `readToken` reads a\nresolved `--instui-*` value (SSR-safe). The custom elements also work directly once `register()`\nhas run."
msgstr "`icon` er Svelte-aðgerð sem teiknar Instructure tákn inn í þátt. `readToken` les útreiknaðan `--instui-*` gildi (öruggt fyrir SSR). Sérsniðnu þættirnir virka einnig beint þegar `register()` hefur keyrt."

#: renderers/svelte/src/interfaces/ActionResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Svelte action's return shape."
msgstr "Uppbygging gilda sem Svelte-aðgerð skilar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createComponentsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the components picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "Býr til verksmiðju fyrir komponentaval (components picker) viðbótina.\nSkilar falli sem hentar fyrir `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createComponentsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  tinymce.PluginManager.add(\n    \"pantokenComponents\",\n    createComponentsPlugin(`{ model, currentAssets, onMissingAsset }`)\n  );"
msgstr "Notkun:\n  tinymce.PluginManager.add(\n    \"pantokenComponents\",\n    createComponentsPlugin(`{ model, currentAssets, onMissingAsset }`)\n  );"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createIconsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the icons picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "Búðu til verksmiðju fyrir táknaval-viðbótina.\nSkilar falli sem hentar fyrir `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the `tinymce.PluginManager.add` callback for the \"Insert layout\" plugin."
msgstr "Býr til `tinymce.PluginManager.add` bakköllunarfallið fyrir \"Insert layout\" viðbótina."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createLogosPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the logos picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "Búa til verksmiðju fyrir logos picker-viðbótina.\nSkilar falli sem hentar fyrir `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createTemplatesPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the `tinymce.PluginManager.add` callback for the \"Insert template\" plugin."
msgstr "Smíðar `tinymce.PluginManager.add` bakkölluna fyrir viðbótina \"Insert template\"."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/findEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Find a component/utility/custom entry by name."
msgstr "Finna íhlut, hjálpareining eða sérsniðna færslu eftir nafni."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/getIconCdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compute the CdnFile for an icon given its source.\nReturns `{ package, path }` for use with @pantoken/cdn's buildFileUrl."
msgstr "Reikna CdnFile fyrir tákn út frá uppsprettu þess.\nSkilar `{ package, path }` til notkunar með @pantoken/cdn's buildFileUrl."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/getModifierSuggestions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Get all modifier suggestions for a component/utility, filtered by an optional prefix.\nReturns array of `{ name, prop, value?, description }` objects."
msgstr "Sækir allar tillögur um breytur fyrir íhlut/verkfæri, síaðar eftir valfrjálsu forskeyti.\nSkilar fylki af `{ name, prop, value?, description }` hlutum."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/injectContentStylesheet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Appends a `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` to the editor's content document `<head>` at runtime.\nIdempotent per URL — calling this twice with the same `url` is a no-op the second time."
msgstr "Appends a `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` to the editor's content document `&lt;head&gt;` at runtime.\nIdempotent per URL — calling this twice with the same `url` is a no-op the second time."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/listComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "List all components (kind: \"component\")."
msgstr "Skrá alla íhluti (gerð: \"component\")."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/listUtilities.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "List all utilities (kind: \"utility\")."
msgstr "Listaðu öll hjálparforrit (kind: \"utility\")."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/loadAllIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Load and merge all available icons from both sources.\nReturns a sorted array tagged with the source package."
msgstr "Hlaða inn og sameina öll tiltæk tákn frá báðum heimildum.\nSkilar raðaðri fylki merktu með uppsprettupakkanum."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/loadAllIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "NOTE: Component icon names are derived from the model's `-icon-*` modifier.\nThis needs to be populated from either `docs/public/icon-manifest.json` (if consumable)\nor a manifest published alongside formats/components model.json.\nFor now, only simple-icons are included."
msgstr "ATH: Tákn­nöfn íhluta eru dregin af módelsins `-icon-*` breytum.\nÞetta þarf að fyllast annaðhvort frá `docs/public/icon-manifest.json` (ef það er nothæft)\neða úr manifesti birtu samhliða formats/components model.json.\nÍ bili eru aðeins simple-icons innifalin."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenContentCssUrls.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolves a set of [CdnFile](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)s to URLs suitable for TinyMCE's `content_css` init option."
msgstr "Umbreytir safni af [CdnFile](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md) í vefslóðir sem henta fyrir TinyMCE's `content_css` init-valkostinn."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenContentCssUrls.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "readonly [`CdnFile`](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)[]"
msgstr "aðeins til lestrar [`CdnFile`](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)[]"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlCompletion.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create a CodeMirror 6 autocomplete extension for pantoken HTML.\nProvides completions for component names and their modifiers."
msgstr "Búa til sjálfklárað (autocomplete) viðbót fyrir CodeMirror 6 fyrir pantoken HTML.\nVeitir tillögur fyrir nöfn íhluta og breytur þeirra."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlCompletion.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlCompletion({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"
msgstr "Notkun:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlCompletion({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlLinter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create a CodeMirror 6 linter extension for pantoken HTML.\nValidates class attributes containing `.instui-*` tokens."
msgstr "Búðu til linter-viðbót fyrir CodeMirror 6 fyrir pantoken HTML.\nStaðfestir class-eiginleika sem innihalda `.instui-*` tákn."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlLinter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlLinter({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"
msgstr "Notkun:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlLinter({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/validateClassToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Validate a pantoken class token (e.g., \"instui-button\", \"instui-button.-color-primary\").\nReturns an array of validation errors (empty if valid)."
msgstr "Staðfesta pantoken flokkstákna (t.d. \"instui-button\", \"instui-button.-color-primary\").\nSkilar fylki af staðfestingarvillum (tómt ef gilt)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One documented CSS record: its base class plus everything derived from the CSS + doc comments."
msgstr "Eitt skjalfest CSS-skjal: grunnflokkur þess auk alls sem er afleitt frá CSS + skjalatextum."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The record name from `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."
msgstr "Heiti skraðarinnar úr `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, t.d. `button`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which kind of CSS surface this documents (defaults to `component`)."
msgstr "Hvaða tegund af CSS-viðmóti þetta skjalfestar (sjálfgefið `component`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "Grunn CSS-valkosti — klasi (`.button`), eign (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), auðkenni (`#foo`),\n eða shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — ályktað frá fyrstu beru-klasa reglu eða stillt sérstaklega með\n `@selector`. Að eilífu ekki tómt (fellur aftur á `.${name}` ef ályktun mistakast)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One-line summary from `@summary`."
msgstr "Einalínusamantekt úr `@summary`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extended prose from `@remarks`."
msgstr "Útvíkkuð ritsmíðartexti úr `@remarks`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal-only prose from `@privateRemarks` (emitters may choose to omit it from public output)."
msgstr "Innri ritsmíðartexti eingöngu úr `@privateRemarks` (útgefarar geta valið að sleppa því frá opinberum úttaki)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The release stage from a modifier flag tag (`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`)."
msgstr "Útgáfustigið úr breytingamerki (`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Version introduced, from `@since`."
msgstr "Útgáfa þar sem það var kynnt, úr `@since`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A documentation group/category, from `@group`/`@category`."
msgstr "Skjalahópur/flokkur, úr `@group`/`@category`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accessibility guidance, from `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."
msgstr "Leiðbeiningar um aðgengi, úr `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set when this record carries a `@global` tag — its modifiers (and per-modifier `@global` flags)\napply to any component/layout/rule/declaration, not just this record's base class. Used during\nvalidation and consumption checks to resolve modifier matches globally."
msgstr "Stillt þegar þessi skrá ber `@global` merkimiða — breytur hennar (og fyrir-breyti `@global` fánar)\ngilda um hvaða íhlut/uppsetningu/reglu/yfirlýsingu sem er, ekki aðeins grunnflokk þessarar skrár. Notað við\nstaðfestingu og neysluathuganir til að leysa breytusamsvörun á heimsvísu."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted modifiers, annotated with `@modifier` prose where authored."
msgstr "Breytingar unnar úr AST, merktar með `@modifier` ritsmíða þar sem þær voru skrifaðar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted sub-element parts (class-based), annotated with `@part` prose where authored."
msgstr "Undir-þáttaskiptingar úr AST (klassabundnar), merktar með `@part` ritsmíða þar sem þær voru skrifaðar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shadow-DOM exposed parts (`::part(name)`), from `@csspart` or a `::part()` selector."
msgstr "Shadow-DOM sýnilegar parts (`::part(name)`), úr `@csspart` eða `::part()` valkosti."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Native pseudo-elements the component styles (`::before`, `::marker`, …), from `@pseudo` or a selector."
msgstr "Innbyggðir pseudo-þættir sem íhluturinn stílar (`::before`, `::marker`, …), úr `@pseudo` eða valkosti."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "States the component reacts to, from `@cssstate`, `:state()`, pseudo-classes, or state classes."
msgstr "Stöður sem íhluturinn bregst við, úr `@cssstate`, `:state()`, pseudo-flokkum eða stöðuflokkum."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Named slots the component shell exposes, from `@slot`."
msgstr "Nefndar slotur sem íhlutarstykkið opnar, úr `@slot`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Allowed HTML elements from `@element` (default + optional named profiles)."
msgstr "Leyfilegir HTML-þættir frá `@element` (sjálfgefið + valfrjáls nefnd sniðmát)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal to-do notes, from `@todo` tags and `/* @todo … */` inline comments. Development notes,\nnot public API — emitters may omit them (like [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks))."
msgstr "Innri „to-do“ athugasemdir, úr `@todo` merkjum og `/* @todo … */` innfelldum athugasemdum. Þróunarnótur,\nekki opinbert API — útgefarar geta sleppt þeim (eins og [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks))."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Design tokens this component consumes: every `--*` custom property referenced via `var(...)` inside\nits rules, each annotated with `@tokens` prose where authored (and including any `@tokens`-declared\ntoken not literally found via `var()`)."
msgstr "Hönnunarmerki sem þessi íhlutur notar: hver `--*` sérsniðin eign sem vísað er til með `var(...)` innan\nreglna hans, hver merkt með `@tokens` ritsmíða þar sem skrifað (og þar með taldar þær `@tokens`-tilkynntu\nmerki sem ekki finnast bókstaflega með `var()`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom properties this component declares (`@property`) or documents (`@cssproperty`)."
msgstr "Sérsniðnar eignir sem þessi íhlutur tilkynnir (`@property`) eða skjalfestar (`@cssproperty`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "CSS custom functions (`@function`) this component defines."
msgstr "CSS sérsniðnar föll (`@function`) sem þessi íhlutur skilgreinir."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animations (`@keyframes`) this component exposes."
msgstr "Sýningar (animations) (`@keyframes`) sem þessi íhlutur opnar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cascade layers (`@layer`) this component participates in."
msgstr "Cascade-lög (`@layer`) sem þessi íhlutur tekur þátt í."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Conditional-support blocks (`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`) the rules sit under."
msgstr "Skilyrtar stuðningsblokkir (`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`) sem reglurnar eru undir."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@example` blocks, verbatim."
msgstr "`@example` blokkir, orðrétt."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The authored `@structure` element tree (top-level nodes), when present. When the `@structure` body\nuses `@variant` blocks (see [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), this holds the first variant's nodes only,\nfor back-compat with any code that hasn't been updated to read `structureVariants`."
msgstr "Ritað `@structure` frumtrjá- (efnis)mynstur (efst í stigi) þegar það er til. Þegar `@structure` líkaminn\nnotar `@variant` blokkir (sjá [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), inniheldur þetta aðeins hnútana úr fyrsta afbrigði,\ntil bakfærni með kóða sem ekki hefur verið uppfærður til að lesa `structureVariants`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alternative DOM shapes for this component, when the authored `@structure` body contains one or\nmore top-level `@variant` blocks — absent for the common case of a single, non-variant structure."
msgstr "Valfrjálsar DOM-lögun fyrir þennan íhlut, þegar ritaði `@structure` líkaminn inniheldur eina eða\nfleiri efstu `@variant` blokkir — fjarverandi fyrir hið algenga tilvik af einu, ekki-afbrigðilegu útliti."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional prose description leading the `@structure` body, when authored."
msgstr "Valfrjáls ritsmíðar-lýsing sem leiðir `@structure` líkamann, þegar hún er rituð."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@demo <spec>` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."
msgstr "`@demo &lt;spec&gt;` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-level deprecation replacement text, when authored (the argument to a `@deprecated` tag)."
msgstr "Íhlutasvæðisbundin úreltunar-íhlutmtexti, þegar ritað (rök í `@deprecated` merki)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@see <ref>` cross-references."
msgstr "`@see &lt;ref&gt;` cross-references."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage prose from `@usage` — how to include the stylesheet / use the component."
msgstr "Notkunarritstæður úr `@usage` — hvernig á að innleiða stílblaðið / nota íhlutinn."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation legend rows from `@annotations`, in author order."
msgstr "Staðbundnar skýringalínu lýsigögn úr `@annotations`, í röð höfundar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation references from `@ref`, in author order."
msgstr "Staðbundnar skýringatengingar úr `@ref`, í röð höfundar."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Record-level object-model decorators."
msgstr "Skjalar-stigs hlutalíkans-auðkenningar (decorators)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Browser-support / feature-compatibility notes from `@compat`."
msgstr "Vafra-/aðgerða-samhæfisathugasemdir úr `@compat`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Related components from `@related`."
msgstr "Tengd íhlutir úr `@related`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Declared family membership from `@memberOf` — this record is a member of another named record,\noptionally `private` (must only ever appear inside that parent). Absent when not authored."
msgstr "Tilkynnt meðlimasamband úr `@memberOf` — þessi skrá er meðlimur annars nefnds skjals,\nvalfrjáls `private` (má aðeins birtast innan foreldrisins). Fjarverandi ef ekki ritað."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Member record names from `@members` — the inverse direction, declared on the parent."
msgstr "Nöfn meðlimaskráa úr `@members` — öfug stefna, tilkynnt á foreldri."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured parent-side member declarations from repeated `@member` tags."
msgstr "Uppbyggðar yfirlýsingar foreldra-hlið meðlimi úr endurteknum `@member` merkjum."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Where the record was authored, when position info is available (for source links)."
msgstr "Hvar skráin var rituð, þegar staðsetningargögn eru tiltæk (fyrir heimildartengla)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content of registered custom (block) tags, keyed by tag name without its `@`. Populated only for\ntags added via configuration; unregistered unknown tags are ignored. Absent when none were found."
msgstr "Innihald skráðra sérsniðinna (block) merkja, með lykli sem er nafn merkisins án `@`. Fyllist aðeins fyrir\nmerki sem bætt var við í stillingum; óskráð óþekkt merki eru hunsuð. Fjarverandi þegar engin fundust."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [createLayoutsPlugin](../functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md)."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir [createLayoutsPlugin](../functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The page layouts offered in the \"Insert layout\" picker. Defaults to [pageLayouts](../variables/pageLayouts.md)."
msgstr "Síðuskipulag sem boðið er upp á í valkassanum „Setja inn skipulag“. Sjálfgefið er [pageLayouts](../variables/pageLayouts.md)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Called after a layout is inserted (e.g. to refresh a live preview)."
msgstr "Kallað eftir að skipulag hefur verið sett inn (t.d. til að endurnýja lifandi forskoðun)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/TaggedIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon with source attribution for tracking which package it comes from."
msgstr "Tákn með heimild um uppruna til að rekja úr hvaða pakka það kemur."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/variables/LAYOUTS_PLUGIN_NAME.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin name to pass in TinyMCE's `plugins`/`toolbar` init options."
msgstr "Heiti viðbótarinnar sem á að senda í TinyMCE's `plugins`/`toolbar` upphafsvalkosti."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/variables/LAYOUTS_TOOLBAR_NAME.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toolbar button/menu item name registered by this plugin."
msgstr "Nafn tækjastika-hnapps/valmyndarliðar sem þessi viðbót skráði."

#: renderers/vitepress/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vitepress` — theme a VitePress site with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vitepress` — sniðmóta VitePress-síðu með Instructure tokens."

#: renderers/vitepress/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "VitePress theming is driven by `--vp-*` CSS variables. This points them at `var(--instui-*)`, so\ndropping the output into `.vitepress/theme/custom.css` (alongside `@pantoken/css`, which defines\nthe custom properties) re-skins the docs with the Instructure look while light/dark keeps flowing\nthrough the same tokens."
msgstr "Þemu í VitePress knýjast af `--vp-*` CSS-breytum. Þetta vísar þeim á `var(--instui-*)`, svo\nað ef útflutningurinn er settur í `.vitepress/theme/custom.css` (hlið við hlið við `@pantoken/css`, sem skilgreinir\nsérsniðnu eiginleikana) klæðir það skjölin í Instructure-útlit meðan ljós/dökk skipting heldur áfram\nað nota sömu tokens."

#: renderers/vitepress/src/interfaces/ToVitePressCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for `toVitePressCss`."
msgstr "Valkostir fyrir `toVitePressCss`."

#: renderers/vitepress/src/variables/VITEPRESS_TO_INSTUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "VitePress CSS variable → the Instructure token it resolves to."
msgstr "VitePress CSS-breytan → Instructure-táknið sem hún leysist upp í."

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve an icon name to inline SVG (empty string when unknown). Pure — the element renders it."
msgstr "Leysa nafn tákns í innlínulega SVG (tómt strengi ef óþekkt). Hreint — þátturinn birtir það."

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name (e.g. `arrow-left`)."
msgstr "Nafn tákns (t.d. `arrow-left`)."

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver (defaults to the built-in pantoken icon set)."
msgstr "Leysirinn (sjálfgefið notar innbyggða pantoken táknasafnið)."

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vue` — a Vue plugin over `@pantoken/web-components`."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vue` — Vue viðbót fyrir `@pantoken/web-components`."

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`install` registers the custom elements and tells Vue's compiler to treat `instui-*` tags as\ncustom elements. `readToken` reads a resolved `--instui-*` value (SSR-safe)."
msgstr "`install` skráir sérsniðna þætti og segir Vue-þýðandanum að meðhöndla `instui-*` merki sem\nsérsniðna þætti. `readToken` les uppleyst gildi `--instui-*` (öruggt fyrir SSR)."

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [PantokenVue](variables/PantokenVue.md)"
msgstr "Endurnefnir og flytur aftur út [PantokenVue](variables/PantokenVue.md)"

#: renderers/vue/src/variables/PantokenVue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The pantoken Vue plugin: `app.use(PantokenVue)` or `app.use(PantokenVue, { locale: \"hu\" })`."
msgstr "pantoken Vue-viðbótin: `app.use(PantokenVue)` eða `app.use(PantokenVue, { locale: \"hu\" })`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) a `register()`-style call threads to every element's\n`define`. The icon resolver is injectable: `register()` always passes the real,\n`@pantoken/icons`-backed [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (unchanged default behavior for every existing caller),\nwhile the per-element CDN build passes [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elements that never call it —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` is a multi-MB dependency, and since Rollup can't code-split\n`iife`/`umd` output, anything statically reachable from a bundle's entry ends up in the whole\nbundle, regardless of whether that specific element's code path ever invokes it. This module has no\ntop-level side effects for exactly that reason — importing it (unlike importing `../index.ts`, which\nauto-registers everything on import) never reaches [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) unless the caller passes it in."
msgstr "Byggja sameiginlega [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) sem `register()`-stíl kallaþræði á hvert elements\n`define`. Táknleysirinn er hægt að sprauta inn: `register()` sendir alltaf hið raunverulega,\n`@pantoken/icons`-studdan [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (óbreytt sjálfgefinn háttur fyrir alla núverandi kölara),\ná meðan CDN-útgáfa fyrir einstök element sendir [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) fyrir element sem kalla það aldrei —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` er margra MB háður, og þar sem Rollup getur ekki kóðaskipt\n`iife`/`umd` útgang, þá endar allt sem er fastanlega aðgengilegt frá inngangsbundli í öllu\nbundlinu, óháð því hvort tiltekinn elementakóði kallar það nokkurn tímann. Þessi eining hefur engin\nefstustigssíðubreytingar af nákvæmlega þeim sökum — að flytja hana inn (ólíkt því að flytja inn `../index.ts`, sem\nsjálfvirkt skráir allt við innflutning) nær aldrei [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) nema kölari gefi það inn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Same shape as `register()`'s options, minus `only`."
msgstr "Sama uppbygging og stillingar `register()`, að undanskildum `only`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registry to define into."
msgstr "Skráningin sem á að skilgreina inn í."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "Leitarinn sem er tengdur við `ctx.iconSvg` — gefðu [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) fyrir raunveruleg tákn\n  eða [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) þegar það er sannað að elementasett kallar aldrei á eitt (sjá\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` í `./elements-meta.ts`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Define the locale subset your app supports. Pass the imported bundle objects as an object\nwhose keys are the locale tags (JavaScript shorthand makes this natural). TypeScript narrows\nthe accepted locale tags to only the keys you provide."
msgstr "Skilgreindu þann hluta tungumála (locale subset) sem forritið þitt styður. Sendu fluttar búnt-objekta sem hlutur þar sem lyklar eru tungumálamerkin (locale tags) — JavaScript skammstöfun gerir þetta eðlilegt. TypeScript þrengir viðurkenndu tungumálamerkin niður í aðeins þá lykla sem þú veitir."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Not calling `createLocaleSet` at all gives the full 44-locale barrel — use this factory only\nwhen you need compile-time validation or explicit tree-shaking signals."
msgstr "Ef ekki er kallað á `createLocaleSet` fæst hinn fulli 44-tungumála pakki — notaðu þessa factory aðeins þegar þú þarft staðfestingu við þýðingu (compile-time) eða skýr merki fyrir tree-shaking."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`K` *extends* `string`"
msgstr "`K` *leiðir af* `string`"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/defineBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create and validate a [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md). Throws when required fields are missing or `locale`\nis not a non-empty string."
msgstr "Býr til og staðfestir [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md). Kastar þegar nauðsynlegir reitir vanta eða `locale`\ner ekki strengur sem er ekki tómur."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatDate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound date/time formatter."
msgstr "Dagsetninga- og tímasniðsformatari sem er bundinn staðbundnum stillingum."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatList.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound list formatter (e.g. `\"a, b, and c\"` in English, with correct conjunctions elsewhere)."
msgstr "Listasniðari bundinn við staðsetningu (t.d. `\"a, b, and c\"` á ensku, með réttum samtengingarorðum annars staðar)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatMessage.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Format an MF2 `source` message for `locale`, substituting `params`. Throws on invalid MF2 syntax\n— validate with `@pantoken/i18n-engine`'s `validateMf2` at build time, not at format time."
msgstr "Sniðið MF2 `source` skilaboð fyrir `locale`, með því að setja inn `params`. Kastar villu ef MF2-setningafræði er ógild\n— staðfestið með `@pantoken/i18n-engine`'s `validateMf2` við byggingatíma, ekki við sniðun."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatMessage.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`messageformat` already isolates each placeholder's formatted value in FSI/PDI bidi marks by\ndefault (its `bidiIsolation: \"default\"` option) — [isolate](isolate.md) is for interpolation done\nOUTSIDE of MF2 formatting, not needed here."
msgstr "`messageformat` aðskilur þegar sniðið gildi hvers fylligáts með FSI/PDI bidi-merkjunum sem sjálfgefið (sín `bidiIsolation: \"default\"` stilling) — [isolate](isolate.md) er fyrir innflettingu sem er framkvæmd\nUTAN við MF2-sniðun og er ekki nauðsynleg hér."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatNumber.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound number formatter (thousands separators, currency, percent, etc.)."
msgstr "Töluforsnið bundið við staðbundna stillingu (þúsundaskil, gjaldmiðill, prósentur o.s.frv.)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatRelativeTime.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound relative-time formatter (e.g. `\"3 days ago\"`)."
msgstr "Staðsetningarbundinn formari fyrir hlutfallslegan tíma (t.d. `\"3 days ago\"`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/getDir.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Return the text direction for a locale — using the [LOCALES](../variables/LOCALES.md) registry for known\nlocales, falling back to `\"ltr\"` for unknown tags."
msgstr "Skilar textastefnu fyrir locale — notar skráninguna [LOCALES](../variables/LOCALES.md) fyrir þekkt locale og fellur aftur á `\"ltr\"` fyrir óþekkt tagg."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/isolate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `value` in Unicode bidi isolates (FSI/PDI) so it doesn't scramble the surrounding text's\ndirection — e.g. a Latin filename embedded in an Arabic sentence built with plain string\nconcatenation. `formatMessage` already does this for MF2 placeholders; use `isolate` only when\ninterpolating outside MF2."
msgstr "Pakkið `value` inn í Unicode bidi-einangra (FSI/PDI) svo það rugli ekki um stefnu umlykjandi textans\nstefnu — t.d. latneskt skráarnafn innfellt í arabíska setningu sem búin er til með einfaldri strengjakeðju\nsamsetningu. `formatMessage` gerir þetta þegar fyrir MF2-fyllingarefni; notið `isolate` aðeins þegar\ninterpolerað er utan MF2."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/makeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a `WebComponentStrings` object for `locale`.\nWeekday names are derived from `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (and rotated to the locale's first day of\nweek); all other strings fall back to English unless provided in `overrides`."
msgstr "Búðu til `WebComponentStrings` hlut fyrir `locale`.\nNöfn vikudaga eru fengin úr `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (og snúið að fyrsta degi\nviku í staðsetningu); öll önnur textastrengi falla aftur á ensku nema þau séu gefin í `overrides`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/noopIconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)-shaped resolver that never resolves anything — for elements that don't need it."
msgstr "Leiðandi lausnari með lögun [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) sem leysir aldrei neitt — fyrir þætti sem þurfa það ekki."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Tekur við fullunna [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *eða* hráum BCP47-tákna sem streng. Þegar strengur er\nsendur, aflar [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) vikudagana með `Intl.DateTimeFormat` og allir aðrir strengir\nfalla aftur á ensku; sendu bundle til að fá fullar þýðingar."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "[LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) hlutur, eða BCP47-tákn (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/resolveFirstDay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "First day of week as a JS `Date.getDay()` index (0=Sunday … 6=Saturday)."
msgstr "Fyrsti dagur vikunnar sem JS `Date.getDay()` vísitala (0=sunnudagur … 6=laugardagur)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — ramma-óháð sérsniðin frumefni fyrir Instructure UI."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (keyrir sjálfkrafa í vafranum) skilgreinir fullan `<instui-*>` frumefnaskipan í hvaða skrá yfir sérsniðin frumefni sem er. Hvert frumefni teiknar samsvarandi `@pantoken/components` CSS inn í skuggarót sína; tokens eru erfdar sérsniðnar eigindir sem skerast í gegnum skuggamörkin — hlaðið `@pantoken/css` til að veita þær."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "Fyrir staðbundna UI-strengi (merkimiðar dagatals, staðgengilstexti í dagsetninga-inntaki, 'Back' texti í drilldown) sendið `locale`, `strings` eða `dir` valkostina til [register](functions/register.md). Fulli Canvas-parity pakkasettið og hjálparfallið [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) eru einnig flutt út úr þessum pakka."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "Módúlið er öruggt fyrir Node: frumefnaflokkar eru skilgreindir innan [register](functions/register.md), sem er engin-aðgerð þegar enginn DOM er til, svo innflutningur meðan á SSR eða byggingu stendur snertir aldrei `HTMLElement`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One registered custom element: its base tag name plus a `define` that registers it via the context."
msgstr "Eitt skráð sérsniðið element: grunnheiti tagsins ásamt `define` sem skráir það í gegnum samhengi."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base tag name, e.g. `button` (minted to `<instui-button>`/`<x-button>` by the active prefix)."
msgstr "The base tag name, e.g. `button` (minted to `&lt;instui-button&gt;`/`&lt;x-button&gt;` by the active prefix)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register the element into `ctx.registry`, using only the shared, prefix-aware helpers."
msgstr "Skráðu elementið í `ctx.registry`, með því að nota aðeins sameiginlegu hjálparfærin sem þekkja forskeyti."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A minimal structural type for a custom-element registry (the DOM's `customElements`)."
msgstr "Lágmarks uppbyggingartegund fyrir skrá yfir sérsniðna þætti (DOM's `customElements`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A fully resolved locale bundle: BCP47 tag, direction, display label, and translated strings."
msgstr "Fullkomlega útfylltur staðbundinn pakki: BCP47-merki, textastefna, birtingarnafn og þýddir strengir."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag (e.g. `\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, `\"zh-Hans\"`)."
msgstr "BCP47 staðbundið merkimiði (t.d. `\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, `\"zh-Hans\"`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction."
msgstr "Textastefna."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable display label."
msgstr "Mannauðlesanlegt birtingarnafn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated UI strings for the web-component element set."
msgstr "Þýddir notendaviðmótsstrengir fyrir safn vef-íhluta."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display label and text-direction metadata for a single locale."
msgstr "Sýna merkimiða og upplýsingar um textastefnu fyrir eina staðfærslu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable label (English + native name where applicable)."
msgstr "Auðlesanleg merkimiði (enska + nafn móðurmálsins þegar við á)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A typed subset of [LocaleBundle](LocaleBundle.md)s. Created by [createLocaleSet](../functions/createLocaleSet.md) to constrain an\napp's supported locales at compile time — registering or retrieving a locale not in the set is a\nTypeScript error."
msgstr "Tegundabundið hlutmengi af [LocaleBundle](LocaleBundle.md). Búið til af [createLocaleSet](../functions/createLocaleSet.md) til að takmarka staðsetningar sem forritið styður við þýðingartíma — að skrá eða sækja staðsetningu sem ekki er í menginu veldur TypeScript-villu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The locale tags included in this set."
msgstr "Staðsetningartákn sem eru í þessu mengi."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Type guard — true when `locale` is in this set."
msgstr "Tegundarvörður — satt þegar `locale` er í þessu mengi."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Return the bundle for `locale`. Throws at runtime when called with an unknown locale."
msgstr "Skilar bundli fyrir `locale`. Kastar við keyrslu ef kallað er með óþekkta staðsetningu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register `@pantoken/web-components` elements with the given locale from this set."
msgstr "Skrá `@pantoken/web-components` þætti með gefinni staðsetningu úr þessu mengi."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The shared state a `register()` call builds once and threads to every [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md).\nIt carries the prefix-aware registry adapter, the `tag()` helper for nested markup, the CSS-class\nprefix `I`, the Invoker Commands support flag + router, the `wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`\nfactories, and locale data (`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`)."
msgstr "Sameiginlegur ástand sem `register()` kall byggir einu sinni og leggur fyrir hvert [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md).\nHann ber með sér forskeyti-vitandi skráningar-aðlaga, `tag()` hjálparfallið fyrir innfellda merkingu, CSS-flokka\nforskeytið `I`, stuðningsmerkimiða + leiðara fyrir Invoker Commands, `wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`\nsmiðjur, og staðsetningargögn (`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The scoped registry: rewrites `instui-<base>` → the active-prefix tag on `get`/`define`."
msgstr "The scoped registry: rewrites `instui-&lt;base&gt;` → the active-prefix tag on `get`/`define`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Map a base name to the active-prefix tag (for nested markup, `querySelector`, `tagName`)."
msgstr "Kortleggja grunnnafn á virkt-forskeyti merkimiða (fyrir innfellda merkingu, `querySelector`, `tagName`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS-class prefix for the inlined component sheets — always `instui`, separate from the tag prefix."
msgstr "CSS-flokka forskeytið fyrir innlimaðar stílblöð íhlutans — alltaf `instui`, aðskilið frá merkis-forskeytinu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether the browser supports the Invoker Commands API (`command`/`commandfor`)."
msgstr "Hvort vafri styður Invoker Commands API-ið (`command`/`commandfor`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Route a target's `command` events (or a click fallback) to a handler."
msgstr "Leiða `command` atburði miðar (eða smelli sem fallback) á markmiði til handfara."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Define a shadow-DOM element: `<style>:host{display}css</style>` + markup from `render(host)`.\n`invoker: true` forwards the host's `popovertarget`/`command` to the inner `<button>` (IDL)."
msgstr "Define a shadow-DOM element: `&lt;style&gt;:host{display}css&lt;/style&gt;` + markup from `render(host)`.\n`invoker: true` forwards the host's `popovertarget`/`command` to the inner `&lt;button&gt;` (IDL)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a `.instui-<name>` class with an optional `-color-<variant>` modifier from `variant`."
msgstr "Build a `.instui-&lt;name&gt;` class with an optional `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier from `variant`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve an icon name to inline SVG (empty string when unknown)."
msgstr "Leysa út táknanafn í innlimað SVG (tóm strengur ef óþekkt)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag used for `toLocaleDateString` and `Intl` formatting."
msgstr "BCP47 staðsetningartagga notuð fyrir `toLocaleDateString` og `Intl` snið."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction derived from the active locale bundle."
msgstr "Textastefna leidd af virku staðbundnu pakkanum."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "First day of week as JS `Date.getDay()` index (0=Sunday … 6=Saturday)."
msgstr "Fyrsti dagur viku sem JS `Date.getDay()` vísir (0=Sunnudagur … 6=Laugardagur)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated UI strings for all behavioral elements."
msgstr "Þýddar notendaviðmótsstrengir fyrir öll hegðunarþáttaeining."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContextOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The options `register()` and [buildRegisterContext](../functions/buildRegisterContext.md) share (everything but `only`, which only\nmakes sense at the `register()` call site — `buildRegisterContext`'s callers decide their own\nelement subset directly)."
msgstr "Valkostirnir `register()` og [buildRegisterContext](../functions/buildRegisterContext.md) deila öllu nema `only`, sem aðeins\nhefur merkingu á kallstað `register()` — `buildRegisterContext`'s kallarar ákveða beint sitt eigið undirmengi atriða)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "All user-visible strings emitted by the web-component element set."
msgstr "Öll notendaviðmótsskilaboð sem vef-íhlutnasafnið (web-component element set) sendir út."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`aria-label` for the calendar's \"previous month\" button."
msgstr "`aria-label` fyrir hnappinn „fyrri mánuður“ í dagatalinu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`aria-label` for the calendar's \"next month\" button."
msgstr "`aria-label` fyrir hnappinn „næsti mánuður“ í dagatalinu."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Weekday column headers in locale-appropriate first-day-of-week order."
msgstr "Dálkhausar fyrir vikudaga í staðbundinni röð með réttan fyrsta vikudag."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Default `aria-label` for `<instui-date-input>` when the `label` attribute is absent."
msgstr "Default `aria-label` for `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` when the `label` attribute is absent."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Default placeholder for the ISO date text field."
msgstr "Sjálfgefið staðgengilstexta fyrir ISO-dagsetningareitinn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`aria-label` for the calendar-open trigger inside `<instui-date-input>`."
msgstr "`aria-label` for the calendar-open trigger inside `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`aria-label` for the native time `<input>` inside `<instui-date-time-input>`."
msgstr "`aria-label` for the native time `&lt;input&gt;` inside `&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/WebComponentStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text for the synthesized Back row in `<instui-drilldown>`."
msgstr "Text for the synthesized Back row in `&lt;instui-drilldown&gt;`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/DEFAULT_PREFIX.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default tag prefix, mirroring the CSS layer — `<instui-icon>`, `.instui-button`, etc."
msgstr "The default tag prefix, mirroring the CSS layer — `&lt;instui-icon&gt;`, `.instui-button`, etc."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/DEFINITIONS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every element definition, in the canonical registration order. The order is load-bearing:\n`date-input` renders a nested `calendar` and `date-time-input` renders a nested `date-input`, and\nthe `ELEMENTS` tuple / the register-order test both derive from this list."
msgstr "Hver skilgreining á einingu, í hinni kanónísku skráningaröð. Röðin er burðarþáttur:\n`date-input` birtir innbyggðan `calendar` og `date-time-input` birtir innbyggðan `date-input`, og\nbæði `ELEMENTS` tuplan og prófið um skráningaröð byggja á þessum lista."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `<instui-icon>` by default, or `<x-icon>` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."
msgstr "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` by default, or `&lt;x-icon&gt;` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ENGLISH_STRINGS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "English defaults used when no locale bundle is provided."
msgstr "Enska sjálfgefin gildi sem notuð eru þegar ekki er gefinn upp staðbundinn búnt."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ICON_ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-<name>` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."
msgstr "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-&lt;name&gt;` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/LOCALES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "All 44 supported locales keyed by BCP47 tag, with direction and display label."
msgstr "Öll 44 studdu tungumálasvæðin merkt með BCP47 tag, með ritstefnu og birtingarnafni."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/NESTED_DEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `<instui-date-time-input>` renders a `<instui-date-input>`, which renders a `<instui-calendar>`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."
msgstr "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` renders a `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;`, which renders a `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-alert>` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-<variant>` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-alert&gt;` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Your changes were saved."
msgstr "Breytingarnar þínar hafa verið vistaðar."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A flat, inline notice."
msgstr "Flöt, innfelld tilkynning."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Arabic (العربية) locale bundle."
msgstr "Arabíska (العربية) tungumálapakki."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-avatar>` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-<variant>`,\n`size` to `-size-<size>`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `<img>` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-avatar&gt;` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`,\n`size` to `-size-&lt;size&gt;`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `&lt;img&gt;` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "JS"
msgstr "JS"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AB"
msgstr "AB"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-badge>` — a small count/status badge. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-<variant>` modifier; slotted content is the count or label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-badge&gt;` — a small count/status badge. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier; slotted content is the count or label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-button>` — a token-styled `<button>`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-<variant>`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-button&gt;` — a token-styled `&lt;button&gt;`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `<instui-context-view>`, `<instui-popover>`, or `<instui-tray>`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`<instui-modal>` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."
msgstr "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, `&lt;instui-popover&gt;`, or `&lt;instui-tray&gt;`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`&lt;instui-modal&gt;` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Vista breytingar"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/contextView.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "More about this item."
msgstr "Meira um þennan hlut."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ca.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Catalan (Catalá) locale bundle."
msgstr "Katalónska (Catalá) staðbundna pakkinn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-calendar>` — an interactive month grid. `value` (`yyyy-mm-dd`) is the selected day and\n`view` (`yyyy-mm-dd`, optional) the visible month. The prev/next chevrons and every day are\n`<button>`s driving the Invoker Commands API (`--calendar-prev`, `--calendar-next`,\n`--calendar-select`) at the grid; selecting a day updates `value`/`view` and dispatches a composed,\nbubbling `change` event (`detail.value` is the ISO date). Renders its own grid (no slot), so it\nworks standalone or nested inside a date picker."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-calendar&gt;` — an interactive month grid. `value` (`yyyy-mm-dd`) is the selected day and\n`view` (`yyyy-mm-dd`, optional) the visible month. The prev/next chevrons and every day are\n`&lt;button&gt;`s driving the Invoker Commands API (`--calendar-prev`, `--calendar-next`,\n`--calendar-select`) at the grid; selecting a day updates `value`/`view` and dispatches a composed,\nbubbling `change` event (`detail.value` is the ISO date). Renders its own grid (no slot), so it\nworks standalone or nested inside a date picker."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/contextView.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-context-view>` — a callout surface with a caret. The host itself is a native `[popover]`\n(top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget`/`command` button can toggle it by id.\nPosition it near its trigger with CSS anchor positioning where supported; otherwise it centres in\nthe top layer. Content goes in the default slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-context-view&gt;` — a callout surface with a caret. The host itself is a native `[popover]`\n(top layer + light-dismiss), so a light-DOM `popovertarget`/`command` button can toggle it by id.\nPosition it near its trigger with CSS anchor positioning where supported; otherwise it centres in\nthe top layer. Content goes in the default slot."

